  <div class="quick-answer">
    <p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> From Gilimanuk Ferry Port to Ubud, you have three main options — public bus (Rp 60,000–90,000, 4–5 hours, transfer at Ubung Terminal), tourist shuttle (Rp 150,000–250,000, ~3.5 hours, hotel drop-off), or private transfer (3.5–4.5 hours, door-to-door). The distance is approximately 127 km. Most travellers pick a private transfer or shuttle for the direct drop-off and comfort.</p>
  </div>

